* "Could you help me break down my recent lab results? I want to make sure I fully understand my current A1C percentage versus my daily blood glucose readings."
* "My GP mentioned a rise in my peak flow. Can you help me understand how this fits into my overall health picture, and does it require any specific action?"

### 3. Anemia & General Health
